---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="錦乃｜世界観について｜日本文化・歴史・城郭クリエイター"
  description="マイクラで和風建築や和風城、御殿、武家屋敷、城下町などを史料文献等の設計図をもとに制作するクリエイター錦乃が織りなす世界について。"
>

<!-- Hero Image -->

<section class="relative h-[820px] overflow-hidden">

  <picture>

    <!-- Smartphone -->
    <source
      media="(max-width: 639px)"
      srcset="/images/about-bg-mobile.png"
    />

    <!-- PC -->
    <img
      src="/images/about-bg.png"
      alt="世界観について"
      class="about-image absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover select-none pointer-events-none"
      draggable="false"
    />

  </picture>

  <!-- Scroll -->

  <div
    class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-20 flex flex-col items-center"
  >

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>

<div class="relative overflow-hidden">

  <!-- Washi Background -->

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg1.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
    draggable="false"
  />

  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/30"></div>

<!-- About -->

<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-32">

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-8">

    <div class="max-w-7xl">

      <p class="scroll-fade delay-1 mb-4 tracking-[0.45em] text-base text-white">
        ABOUT
      </p>

      <h1
        class="scroll-fade delay-2 text-3xl font-light leading-tight text-white"
        style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
      >
        世界観について
      </h1>

      <p
        class="scroll-fade delay-3 mt-10 text-base leading-8 text-white"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >

        昔の町並みって、<br><br>

        どんな景色だったんだろう。<br>
        そこを歩いたら、どんな空気を感じるんだろう。<br><br>

        そんな素朴な憧れから、歴史ある建物や街並みを自分の手で作り始めました。和風のお城や御殿、城下町、神社、武家屋敷や庭園......<br><br>

      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_380px]">

        <p
          class="scroll-fade delay-1 text-base leading-8 text-white"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

          古写真や古地図文献や残る設計図を調べながら、<br>
          当時の空間をひとつずつ形にしています。<br><br>

          調べるほどに知ることが増え、<br>
          建築の構造や人々の暮らし、<br>
          そこに息づいていた文化の奥深さに<br>
          惹かれていきました。<br><br>

          この場所は「現実では実現しないあんな景色を歩いてみたい。」<br>
          そんな感情を一緒に楽しめる世界です。

        </p>

        <a
          href="/works/"
          class="scroll-fade delay-2 group block overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem]"
        >

          <img
            src="/images/works-preview.png"
            alt="制作作品一覧"
            class="h-[360px] w-full object-cover transition duration-700 ease-out group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:scale-105"
          />

        </a>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

<section class="relative py-32">

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-8">

    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">

      <!-- PLAY STYLE -->

      <article
        class="scroll-fade delay-1 rounded-[2rem] border border-white/60 bg-white/85 p-7 lg:p-8 backdrop-blur-sm transition duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl"
      >

        <p class="text-base tracking-[0.35em] text-neutral-500">
          ⋆﻿˙𝓹𝓵𝓪𝔂 𝓼𝓽𝔂𝓵𝔢˙⋆﻿
        </p>

        <h2
          class="mt-4 text-2xl"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          遊び方
        </h2>

        <p
          class="mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-neutral-700"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

          普段からクリエイティブで日本の建物を中心に建築をしています。<br>
          気が付けばすぐMinecraftを開いていて、朝から深夜まで一日中遊んでいることも。<br><br>
          「和風建築勢」と名乗ってはいるものの、これまで作ってきたものに和風建築が多かっただけで、実はジャンルにこだわりはなかったりします。<br>思いついたものを自由に作るのこそが、うちの一番好きな遊び方です。

        </p>

      </article>

      <!-- BUILDING -->

      <article
        class="scroll-fade delay-2 rounded-[2rem] border border-white/60 bg-white/85 p-7 lg:p-8 backdrop-blur-sm transition duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl"
      >

        <p class="text-base tracking-[0.35em] text-neutral-500">
          ⋆﻿˙𝓫𝓾𝓲𝓵𝓭𝓲𝓷𝓰˙⋆﻿
        </p>

        <h2
          class="mt-4 text-2xl"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          制作ジャンル
        </h2>

        <p
          class="mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-neutral-700"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

          史料・古写真・図面に基づいた和風建築

          ・日本の城<br>
          ・御殿・武家屋敷<br>
          ・神社・お寺・仏閣<br>
          ・庭園<br>
          ・城下町・宿場町<br>
          ・古民家・町家<br>
          ・江戸時代の町並み<br><br>

          の忠実な復元・再現から<br><br>

          ・船舶などの乗り物<br>
          ・ファンタジー・洋風建築<br>
          ・現代<br>
          ・キャラクター<br><br>

          に至るまで幅広く形にしています。

        </p>

      </article>

      <!-- LINK -->

      <article
        class="scroll-fade delay-3 rounded-[2rem] border border-white/60 bg-white/85 p-7 lg:p-8 backdrop-blur-sm transition duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl"
      >

        <p class="text-base tracking-[0.35em] text-neutral-500">
          ⋆﻿˙𝓵𝓲𝓷𝓴˙⋆﻿
        </p>

        <h2
          class="mt-4 text-2xl"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          SNS
        </h2>

        <div
          class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-base text-neutral-700"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

          <div>

            <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-7">
              制作風景や建築写真、<br>
              Minecraft作品の公開や日々の活動を発信しています。
            </p>

          </div>

          <div class="pt-6 border-t border-neutral-300 text-base break-all space-y-3">

            <a
              href="https://www.youtube.com/@NISHIKINO_Official"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block hover:underline"
            >
              ♦️
              <span class="text-neutral-500">
                YouTube（@NISHIKINO_Official）
              </span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="https://x.com/nishikinolab"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block hover:underline"
            >
              🐦
              <span class="text-neutral-500">
                X（NishikinoLab）
              </span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/nishikinolab/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block hover:underline"
            >
              🌏
              <span class="text-neutral-500">
                PlanetMinecraft（nishikinolab）
              </span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="https://www.tiktok.com/@nishikino_official"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block hover:underline"
            >
              🎸
              <span class="text-neutral-500">
                TikTok（@nishikino_official）
              </span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/nishikinolab_official/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block hover:underline"
            >
              📸
              <span class="text-neutral-500">
                Instagram（nishikinolab_official）
              </span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="https://www.pixiv.net/users/72809287"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block hover:underline"
            >
              🎨
              <span class="text-neutral-500">
                Pixiv（users/72809287）
              </span>
            </a>

          </div>

        </div>

      </article>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>

</div>

<style>

.about-image{
  animation:aboutFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;
  transform-origin:center;
}

@keyframes aboutFloat{

0%{
transform:translateY(0) scale(1.05);
}

50%{
transform:translateY(-15px) scale(1.08);
}

100%{
transform:translateY(0) scale(1.025);
}

}

/* ---------------- Scroll Animation ---------------- */

.scroll-fade{

opacity:0;

transform:
translateY(70px)
scale(.96);

transition:
opacity .9s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),
transform .9s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);

will-change:transform,opacity;

}

.scroll-fade.show{

animation:aboutBounce .9s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) forwards;

}

.delay-1{
transition-delay:0ms;
}

.delay-2{
transition-delay:140ms;
}

.delay-3{
transition-delay:280ms;
}

@keyframes aboutBounce{

0%{

opacity:0;

transform:
translateY(70px)
scale(.96);

}

65%{

opacity:1;

transform:
translateY(-10px)
scale(1.02);

}

100%{

opacity:1;

transform:
translateY(0)
scale(1);

}

}


:global(html) {
  color-scheme: light;
}

:global(body) {
  color-scheme: light;
  -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
}



:global(#about) {
  color-scheme: light;
}


section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-32 p.text-white {
  color: #ffffff !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
}


/* 世界観について */

section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-32 h1 {
  color: #ffffff !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
}


/* Introduction body */

section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-32 > div > div > p {
  color: #ffffff !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
}


section.relative.py-32 article {
  color-scheme: light;

  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) !important;

  border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6) !important;
}


/* Card headings */

section.relative.py-32 article h2 {
  color: #171717 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #171717;
}


/* Card category labels */

section.relative.py-32 article > p:first-child {
  color: #737373 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #737373;
}


/* Card main text */

section.relative.py-32 article > p:not(:first-child) {
  color: #404040 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #404040;
}


section.relative.py-32 article .text-neutral-700 {
  color: #404040 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #404040;
}


/* SNS introductory text */

section.relative.py-32 article .text-neutral-700 p {
  color: #404040 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #404040;
}


/* SNS links */

section.relative.py-32 article a {
  color: #171717 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #171717;
}


/* SNS URL */

section.relative.py-32 article a span.text-neutral-500 {
  color: #737373 !important;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: #737373;
}


/* SNS divider */

section.relative.py-32 article .border-t {
  border-color: #d4d4d4 !important;
}



section.relative.py-32 article {
  forced-color-adjust: none;
  -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
}



@media (max-width: 639px) {

  /* Hero / About text */

  section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-32 p.text-white,
  section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-32 h1,
  section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-32 > div > div > p {
    color: #ffffff !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* Cards */

  section.relative.py-32 article {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) !important;
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6) !important;

    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* Card labels */

  section.relative.py-32 article > p:first-child {
    color: #737373 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #737373;
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* Card headings */

  section.relative.py-32 article h2 {
    color: #171717 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #171717;
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* Card text */

  section.relative.py-32 article > p:not(:first-child),
  section.relative.py-32 article .text-neutral-700,
  section.relative.py-32 article .text-neutral-700 p {
    color: #404040 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #404040;
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* SNS links */

  section.relative.py-32 article a {
    color: #171717 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #171717;
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* SNS URL */

  section.relative.py-32 article a span.text-neutral-500 {
    color: #737373 !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #737373;
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }


  /* SNS divider */

  section.relative.py-32 article .border-t {
    border-color: #d4d4d4 !important;
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }

}

</style>

<script>

const observer=new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{

entries.forEach((entry)=>{

if(entry.isIntersecting){

entry.target.classList.add("show");

observer.unobserve(entry.target);

}

});

},{
threshold:.18,
rootMargin:"0px 0px -8% 0px"
});

document.querySelectorAll(".scroll-fade").forEach((el)=>{

observer.observe(el);

});

</script>

</Layout>
